{
  "Package": "SIMD",
  "Type": "Package",
  "Title": "Statistical Inferences with MeDIP-seq Data (SIMD) to infer the\nmethylation level for each CpG site",
  "Version": "1.29.0",
  "Author": "Yan Zhou",
  "Maintainer": "Jiadi Zhu <2160090406@email.szu.edu.cn>",
  "Description": "This package provides a inferential analysis method for\ndetecting differentially expressed CpG sites in MeDIP-seq data.\nIt uses statistical framework and EM algorithm, to identify\ndifferentially expressed CpG sites. The methods on this package\nare described in the article 'Methylation-level Inferences and\nDetection of Differential Methylation with Medip-seq Data' by\nYan Zhou, Jiadi Zhu, Mingtao Zhao, Baoxue Zhang, Chunfu Jiang\nand Xiyan Yang (2018, pending publication).",
